                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "E067Cu",
                      "name": "Paragraph Text",
                      "fill": "#26282D",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "万寿节前一日，紫禁城内张灯结彩，午门外的丹陛桥两侧，锦绣旌旗迎风招展。",
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "WlSkK",
                  "name": "Paragraph 2",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#00000000",
                  "cornerRadius": 4,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": [
                    3,
                    10
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ZthYg",
                      "name": "Paragraph Text",
                      "fill": "#26282D",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "林砚随着礼部官员的引导，穿过层层仪仗，来到了奉天殿前的丹墀。殿内金樽玉案，文武百官依品阶列坐，暖阁中隐约传来丝竹之声。",
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "crm8a",
                  "name": "Paragraph 3",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#00000000",
                  "cornerRadius": 4,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": [
                    3,
                    10
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "cEqQi",
                      "name": "Paragraph Text",
                      "fill": "#26282D",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "“林翰林，”礼部尚书赵志皓抬手示意，“今日圣上心情颇佳，诸位但得尽心祝寿。”",
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "qTyuH",
                  "name": "Paragraph 4",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#00000000",
                  "cornerRadius": 4,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": [
                    3,
                    10
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "c14px",
                      "name": "Paragraph Text",
                      "fill": "#26282D",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "未几，万历皇帝在内侍的簇拥下步入殿中。龙袍上的十二章纹在烛光下流转，皇帝面色看不真切，却在落座后先问了两句边关军务。",
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "N4u6O9",
                  "name": "Paragraph 5",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "$primary-soft",
                  "cornerRadius": 4,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": [
                    8,
                    10
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "eyiZ9",
                      "name": "Paragraph Text",
                      "fill": "#26282D",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "殿内一时寂静。林砚心知这是试探，遂起身奏道：“陛下圣明，学生斗胆以为，科学之弊，非一日之寒，将在乡间，源在取士之法与考察之实。”",
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "GpLci",
                  "name": "Paragraph 6",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#00000000",
                  "cornerRadius": 4,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": [
                    3,
                    10
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "a8uPX",
                      "name": "Paragraph Text",
                      "fill": "#26282D",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "皇帝目光转向他，似有兴趣：“你有何法？”",
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "Ld667",
                  "name": "Paragraph 7",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#00000000",
                  "cornerRadius": 4,
